<section id="camara" aria-labelledby="camera-title" class="relative w-full overflow-hidden bg-[#000004] pt-16 pb-10 lg:py-16 scroll-mt-20">
  <div class="relative z-10 mx-auto flex max-w-5xl flex-col items-center justify-between gap-8 px-5 sm:px-6 lg:flex-row lg:gap-16">
    <div class="order-2 flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col justify-center text-center lg:order-1 lg:w-1/2 lg:text-left">
      <h2 id="camera-title" class="font-title mb-4 text-2xl font-bold uppercase leading-tight tracking-tighter text-white sm:text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl lg:leading-none">
        Registro visual<br />
        <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-rojo-light to-azul-light bg-clip-text text-transparent">XIAO ESP32S3 Sense</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="mx-auto max-w-xl text-sm font-light leading-relaxed text-gray-300 md:text-base lg:mx-0">
        La XIAO ESP32S3 Sense graba el descenso de PATSARHI-1. Sus imágenes ayudan a observar el bosque y estudiar cambios de uso de suelo.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="relative order-1 grid w-full max-w-md grid-cols-2 items-center gap-3 sm:gap-8 lg:order-2 lg:w-1/2 lg:max-w-none" aria-label="Vistas de la XIAO ESP32S3 Sense">
      <div class="pointer-events-none absolute left-1/2 top-1/2 -z-10 h-48 w-64 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 rounded-full bg-azul-light/20 blur-[80px]"></div>
      <figure class="flex min-w-0 flex-col items-center gap-3">
        <img src="/xiaofrente.png" alt="Vista frontal de la cámara XIAO ESP32S3 Sense" width="237" height="311" loading="lazy" class="block h-auto max-h-48 w-full object-contain drop-shadow-2xl transition-transform duration-700 ease-out hover:scale-105 sm:max-h-64 lg:max-h-72" />
        <figcaption class="text-center font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wide text-gray-400 sm:text-xs sm:tracking-widest">Frente</figcaption>
      </figure>
      <figure class="flex min-w-0 flex-col items-center gap-3">
        <img src="/xiaoatras.png" alt="Vista posterior de la XIAO ESP32S3 Sense" width="237" height="311" loading="lazy" class="block h-auto max-h-48 w-full object-contain drop-shadow-2xl transition-transform duration-700 ease-out hover:scale-105 sm:max-h-64 lg:max-h-72" />
        <figcaption class="text-center font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wide text-gray-400 sm:text-xs sm:tracking-widest">Parte posterior</figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
